flowchart TD
    A([Start checkTelegram])

    A --> B{WiFi Connected?}

    B -- No --> C([Return])

    B -- Yes --> D[Get New Telegram Messages]

    D --> E{New Messages?}

    E -- No --> C

    E -- Yes --> F[handleNewMessages]

    F --> G[Get Next Batch of Messages]

    G --> H{telegramResetFlag?}

    H -- Yes --> I[ESP.restart]

    H -- No --> J{telegramUpdateFlag?}

    J -- No --> K{More Messages?}

    J -- Yes --> L[Clear Update Flag]

    L --> M[performOTA]

    M --> N{OTA Failed?}

    N -- Yes --> O[Send 'OTA Update Failed'<br/>Telegram Message]

    N -- No --> P[Send 'OTA Successful'<br/>Telegram Message]

    O --> K
    P --> K

    K -- Yes --> F
    K -- No --> C
